{"id":"n68950-3-7","stage":5,"title":"우뚝 · 愣住","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68950-3-7-1","ko":"왜 갑자기 우뚝 멈춰 서?","zh":"怎么突然停下来了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"우뚝","meaning":"愣住，呆住","explanation":"우뚝：愣住，呆住。","readings":[{"term":"우뚝","audio":"/audio/2cf623246fd5264e36c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68950","senseId":"3","lemma":"우뚝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우뚝","audio":"/audio/2cf623246fd5264e36c9.mp3"}},{"text":"멈춰","meaning":"停，止","explanation":"멈추다：停，止；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"멈추다","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46133","senseId":"2","lemma":"멈추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멈춰","audio":"/audio/9a01f98d4e3de46cfc54.mp3"}},{"text":"서?","meaning":"停","explanation":"서다：停；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"13","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서","audio":"/audio/a5bc3484406e4a8fc29e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"2cf623246fd5264e","term":"우뚝","zh":"愣住，呆住","audio":"/audio/2cf623246fd5264e36c9.mp3","entryId":"68950","definition":"活动着的突然停住的样子。","pronunciation":["우뚝"]},{"id":"eaee887b30c38d73","term":"멈추다","zh":"停，止","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3","entryId":"46133","definition":"动作或状态不再持续。","pronunciation":["멈추다"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"停","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"从某个地方去其他地方时中途停下。","pronunciation":["서다"]}],"audio":"/audio/90c8b61d109db7867bbb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68950-3-7-2","ko":"집에 뭔가를 놓고 온 것 같아. 다시 되돌아가야겠어.","zh":"好像把什么东西忘在家里了，得再回去拿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"뭔가를","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭔가를","audio":"/audio/feebddec94b0f55aec1e.mp3"}},{"text":"놓고","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓고","audio":"/audio/4d87d21ee2c596006dc8.mp3"}},{"text":"온","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온","audio":"/audio/dcc56310451956332238.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再，再次","explanation":"다시：再，再次。","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"1","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}},{"text":"되돌아가야겠어.","meaning":"回去，返回","explanation":"되돌아가다：回去，返回；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되돌아가다","audio":"/audio/5577e2eb131762a08c93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14923","senseId":"1","lemma":"되돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되돌아가야겠어","audio":"/audio/68a812b424f47ae8771d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再，再次","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"反复相同的话或行动。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"5577e2eb131762a0","term":"되돌아가다","zh":"回去，返回","audio":"/audio/5577e2eb131762a08c93.mp3","entryId":"14923","definition":"重新回到原来的地方。","pronunciation":["되도라가다","뒈도라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7082bbf8583f3627eb6f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.297,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68950","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1237,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["怎么突然停下来了？","好像把什么东西忘在家里了，得再回去拿。","爸爸，怀我时家里做过什么胎梦？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么突然停下来了？","好像把什么东西忘在家里了，得再回去拿。","爸爸，怀我时家里做过什么胎梦？"],"answer":1}]}
